# Icons

Interface icons are one line set. A filled pictogram does not sit next to a stroke icon for the same kind of control.

## Stroke

- View box `0 0 24 24`.
- `fill: none`, `stroke: currentColor`, `stroke-width: var(--icon-stroke)` (`1.8` in `src/styles.css`).
- `stroke-linecap` and `stroke-linejoin` are `round`.
- Sport marks come only from `SportIcon` in `src/components/sport-icon.tsx`. Every key is a line icon on that same view box.

## One glyph per idea

Reuse the existing path. Do not draw a second pin, heart, chevron, or star.

- Place: `M12 21s7-5.2 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 6.8 7 12 7 12z` plus a circle at `12,9` r `2.4`.
- Direction: `M14 6l-6 6 6 6` and `M10 6l6 6-6 6`.
- Favorite: `M19 21l-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z` (`FAVORITE_BOOKMARK`).

## Allowed fills

- Rating stars stay filled (`#ffb400`).
- Brand marks stay their official shape (Telegram plane). Do not redraw them as generic line icons.

## Like, favorite, share

The bookmark and the share mark stay strokes everywhere, including the pressed state. The active mark is `color: var(--primary)`. It does not fill the shape. The thumb fills when this account placed it: on a catalog card and on the public portrait, `.trainer-card__like.is-liked` fills the thumb with `currentColor` and hides the wrist stroke. Idle stays a stroke. The dialog thumb is the same: idle stays a stroke, and `.direct-bubble__like.is-on` fills that thumb with `currentColor`. The bookmark, the thumb, and the share nodes use one view box and `--icon-stroke`. Every photo action stack — catalog cards and the public portrait — rests at 85% opacity. Hover or focus on that card restores full strength, and hover on one mark still lifts its circle and stroke. A like this account placed stays `var(--primary)`, including while the pointer is on it. The public portrait uses the same disc, hit area, and gap as a catalog card. The like count is a digit on that thumb for everyone, including a guest. The owner of the card does not place a like on it.

```css
/* wrong: a saved bookmark turns solid */
.profile-save svg { fill: currentColor; }

/* right: the same stroke, the brand color marks it */
.profile-save.is-saved { color: var(--primary); }
.profile-save svg { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; }

/* right: a placed like is solid coral; the idle thumb stays a stroke */
.trainer-card__like.is-liked { color: var(--primary); }
.trainer-card__like.is-liked svg path:last-of-type { fill: currentColor; stroke: none; }
```

## Direct messages

The write mark is one outline plane (`DirectMark`). On a contact row it sits in a coral rounded square the same size as the Instagram mark. Hover moves that square 2px up and right. The inbox mark stays an envelope (`MESSAGE_ENVELOPE`) with rounded corners and a curved flap. On a catalog card the same outline plane sits after the bookmark, in the white disc with the other photo actions.

## Do not

- Mix a `0 0 1000 1000` filled library icon with a 24px line icon in one row.
- Set a one-off `stroke-width: 2`, `2.2`, or `2.4` on a custom icon.
- Restyle icons inside `src/components/ui/` (those stay Lucide).
